{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_003_densenet-title\">DenseNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">每层对所有前层输出做通道 concat，而非仅连接相邻层或做残差相加。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Every layer concatenates feature maps from all preceding layers along the channel axis rather than summing adjacent residuals.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像或前一 transition 的特征图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Input image or feature maps from the preceding transition block</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">复用全部前层表示的分类或编码特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Classification logits or multi-scale concatenated dense features reusing all earlier layers</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.1, 3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Huang_Densely_Connected_Convolutional_CVPR_2017_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_003_densenet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_003_densenet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DenseNet original paper architecture figure, Figures 1 and 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/54df07934d480169d323.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.1, 3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_003_densenet\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_003_densenet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_003_densenet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Convolutional Stem</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">建立初始低层视觉特征。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Extracts initial low-level visual feature representations.</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"建立初始低层视觉特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Extracts initial low-level visual feature representations.\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"卷积 Stem\" data-node-name-en=\"Convolutional Stem\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Convolutional Stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">建立初始低层视觉特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Extracts initial low-level visual feature representations.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保存 dense block 内此前所有层的输出。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Accumulates feature maps produced by all preceding layers within the dense block.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"特征库\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">特征库</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保存 dense block 内此前所有层的输出。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Accumulates feature maps produced by all preceding layers within the dense block.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"第 l 层输入为 [x0,…,x(l−1)]，不是逐元素相加。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Layer l receives channel concatenation [x_0, …, x_{l-1}] rather than element-wise addition.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"通道拼接\" data-node-name-en=\"Channel Concatenation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通道拼接</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Channel Concatenation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">第 l 层输入为 [x0,…,x(l−1)]，不是逐元素相加。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Layer l receives channel concatenation [x_0, …, x_{l-1}] rather than element-wise addition.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"BN–ReLU–1×1 Conv 控制进入 3×3 卷积的通道成本。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Pre-activation BN–ReLU–1×1 bottleneck compresses channel width prior to 3×3 spatial convolution.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"1×1 Bottleneck\" data-node-name-en=\"1×1 Bottleneck\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>1×1 Bottleneck</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">BN–ReLU–1×1 Conv 控制进入 3×3 卷积的通道成本。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Pre-activation BN–ReLU–1×1 bottleneck compresses channel width prior to 3×3 spatial convolution.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每层只新增 k 个通道，k 为 growth rate。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Each composite layer appends exactly k new feature channels governed by growth rate k.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3×3 Growth\" data-node-name-en=\"3×3 Growth\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3×3 Growth</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每层只新增 k 个通道，k 为 growth rate。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Each composite layer appends exactly k new feature channels governed by growth rate k.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"新特征回写特征库并供所有后续层直接访问。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Appends newly generated features to the shared bank for direct access by all subsequent layers.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Dense Block\" data-node-name-en=\"Dense Block\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Dense Block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">新特征回写特征库并供所有后续层直接访问。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Appends newly generated features to the shared bank for direct access by all subsequent layers.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 Conv 与平均池化压缩通道和空间尺寸。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Transition layer (1×1 conv + 2×2 average pooling) compresses both channel count and spatial grid resolution.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Transition\" data-node-name-en=\"Transition\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Transition</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 Conv 与平均池化压缩通道和空间尺寸。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Transition layer (1×1 conv + 2×2 average pooling) compresses both channel count and spatial grid resolution.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局池化后输出分类，或导出 dense features 供下游使用。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies global pooling for classification or exports multi-scale dense features to downstream decoders.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"GAP + Head\" data-node-name-en=\"GAP + Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_003_densenet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>GAP + Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局池化后输出分类，或导出 dense features 供下游使用。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies global pooling for classification or exports multi-scale dense features to downstream decoders.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DenseNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 第 ℓ 层拼接全部早期特征</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Layer ℓ Channel Concatenation Across All Preceding States</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DenseNet：核心公式 · 第 ℓ 层拼接全部早期特征\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"3\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.121461pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.892107 -69.079189 110.694944 9.121461\" width=\"110.694944pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.803903 0V-.23821C4.645096-.287837 4.575619-.327539 4.506141-.436718L3.037178-2.699714L4.039646-3.950317C4.228229-4.178602 4.426737-4.287781 4.734425-4.337408V-4.575619H3.066955V-4.337408C3.156283-4.327483 3.235687-4.317558 3.265463-4.317558C3.493748-4.307632 3.573151-4.24808 3.573151-4.099198S3.473897-3.781585 3.195985-3.463972C3.136433-3.404419 2.987551-3.215836 2.83867-3.007402C2.779118-3.07688 2.739416-3.136433 2.70964-3.176134C2.392026-3.593002 2.133965-4.019795 2.133965-4.148825C2.133965-4.267931 2.272921-4.327483 2.60046-4.337408V-4.575619H.119105V-4.337408C.377166-4.297707 .436718-4.24808 .635227-3.950317L1.905681-1.995009C1.617843-1.627769 1.349857-1.30023 1.260528-1.161274C.704705-.426793 .506196-.258061 .138956-.23821V0H1.816352V-.23821C1.459037-.258061 1.320081-.327539 1.320081-.47642S1.578142-1.042169 