403-.158807V0H2.36225V-.158807C1.766725-.23821 1.657545-.307688 1.657545-.595525C1.657545-.665003 1.667471-.744406 1.687321-.813884L2.342399-3.235687H5.171144L4.525991-.893288C4.367185-.377166 4.168676-.228285 3.523524-.158807V0H6.233164Z\" id=\"m003_g16-29\"></path><path d=\"M1.796501-.426793C1.796501-.734481 1.53844-.992542 1.240677-.992542S.694779-.744406 .694779-.426793C.694779-.049627 1.032244 .10918 1.240677 .10918S1.796501-.059553 1.796501-.426793Z\" id=\"m003_g16-149\"></path><path d=\"M1.935457-.059553C1.935457-.883362 1.359783-1.012393 1.131498-1.012393C.883362-1.012393 .555824-.863512 .555824-.436718C.555824-.039702 .913139 .059553 1.1712 .059553C1.240677 .059553 1.290305 .049627 1.320081 .039702C1.359783 .029776 1.389559 .019851 1.40941 .019851C1.478888 .019851 1.548365 .069478 1.548365 .158807C1.548365 .34739 1.389559 .794034 .734481 1.210901L.82381 1.399484C1.121572 1.30023 1.935457 .645152 1.935457-.059553Z\" id=\"m003_g16-150\"></path><use id=\"m003_g10-185\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g7-185\"></use><use id=\"m003_g10-186\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g7-186\"></use><use id=\"m003_g10-187\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g7-187\"></use><use id=\"m003_g10-188\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g7-188\"></use></defs><g id=\"m003_page1\"><use x=\"-69.011212\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g2-120\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-64.058981\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g13-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"-56.942624\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g4-61\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-47.580026\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-29\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-40.316459\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g13-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"-35.4693\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g10-185\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"-31.155479\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g10-187\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-27.539061\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g2-120\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-22.557741\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g20-48\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"-18.423251\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-14.162617\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g2-120\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-9.181297\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g20-49\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"-5.046807\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-.626773\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-149\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"3.853053\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-149\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"8.33288\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-149\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"12.653266\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g16-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"16.9139\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g2-120\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"21.866131\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g13-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"26.007948\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g7-0\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"30.924304\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g20-49\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"35.058778\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g10-188\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"38.974092\" xlink:href=\"#m003_g10-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">深层网络中特征传播与梯度传递受阻，并会重复学习相似表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Deep networks suffered from attenuated feature propagation and redundant re-learning of low-level representations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">每层接收全部前层特征的拼接并以 growth rate 控制宽度</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Feed each layer the channel-wise concatenation of all prior layers within a block while bounding width via a fixed growth rate k.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">密集短路径带来显式特征复用和较少参数</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Dense short paths enforce explicit multi-scale feature reuse with high parameter efficiency.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">DenseNet-121 成为胸片经典主干，H-DenseUNet 用于肝肿瘤分割</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">DenseNet-121 became a canonical chest X-ray backbone (CheXNet); H-DenseUNet extended dense connectivity to 3D liver tumor segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">结构思想仍有价值，但 activation memory 较大</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Enduring architectural principle, though channel concatenation incurs high GPU activation memory in 3D.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">密集拼接使每层直接访问低层与高层特征，强化特征复用。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">growth rate 把网络宽度增长显式化，参数可少于同深度普通 CNN。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">短连接改善特征和梯度传播，但拼接会增加 activation memory。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Feed each layer the channel-wise concatenation of all prior layers within a block while bounding width via a fixed growth rate k.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Dense short paths enforce explicit multi-scale feature reuse with high parameter efficiency.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Layer ℓ Channel Concatenation Across All Preceding States.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">DenseNet-121 长期用于胸片编码，H-DenseUNet 将密集连接扩展到肝脏分割。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">3D 任务中应把拼接造成的显存增长与参数量优势分开报告。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: DenseNet-121 became a canonical chest X-ray backbone (CheXNet); H-DenseUNet extended dense connectivity to 3D liver tumor segmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Enduring architectural principle, though channel concatenation incurs high GPU activation memory in 3D.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Huang_Densely_Connected_Convolutional_CVPR_2017_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Densely Connected Convolutional Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/liuzhuang13/DenseNet\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
